=== Test: position:relative left=10 top=5 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (10,5 100x50) [pos=relative] text="Relative"

---

=== Test: position:absolute left=10 top=20 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (10,20 100x50) [pos=absolute] text="Absolute"

---

=== Test: relative 容器内 absolute 子元素 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 400x300) [pos=relative]
  div (50,30 100x80) [pos=absolute] text="Child"

---

=== Test: Block 流堆叠 + padding ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 300x78)
  div (10,10 300x30) text="Line 1"
  div (10,48 300x30) text="Line 2"

---

=== Test: border 对布局的影响 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 200x100) bw=2 text="Bordered"

---

=== Test: z-index 层级顺序 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 300x200) [pos=relative]
  div (0,0 200x100) [pos=absolute] text="Top"
  div (20,20 200x100) [pos=absolute] text="Bottom"

---

=== Test: absolute right=20 bottom=10 从右下角定位 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 400x300) [pos=relative]
  div (280,240 100x50) [pos=absolute] text="BR"

---

=== Test: position:fixed 相对于视口定位 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (100,200 120x60) [pos=fixed] text="Fixed"

---

=== Test: absolute 居中 left=0 right=0 margin=auto ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 400x200) [pos=relative]
  div (300,120 200x60) [pos=absolute] text="Center"

---

=== Test: 多 absolute 叠加 z-index 控制层级 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 400x300) [pos=relative]
  div (10,10 200x100) [pos=absolute] text="Top"
  div (30,30 200x100) [pos=absolute] text="Bottom"
  div (50,50 200x100) [pos=absolute] text="Front"

---

=== Test: relative 负偏移 left=-10 top=-5 不影响流 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 400x120)
  div (0,0 400x40) text="Normal 1"
  div (-10,35 400x40) [pos=relative] text="Relative"
  div (0,80 400x40) text="Normal 2"

---

=== Test: 多级 relative 嵌套 absolute 深度 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 500x400) [pos=relative]
  div (20,20 400x300) [pos=relative]
    div (30,30 100x80) [pos=absolute] text="Deep"

